{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1510","id":4020089020,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vnbC8","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1510","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1510.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1510.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1510","number":1510,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: integrate post-attempt MS source reveal UI","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1494\n\n## Summary\n\nIntegrates the minimal learner-facing post-attempt Mark Scheme source reveal surface into the learning runtime UI. The surface is feature-flagged under `v1_ms_source_reveal_runtime`, default-off, and only enabled for local/staging/closed_alpha configurations.\n\nThe implementation keeps pre-attempt state redacted: no source panel render, no route request object, no preload/prefetch, and no controlled MS asset refs exposed by the view model. After a submitted answer or student-confirmed attempt, the panel can call the controlled reveal route only through the reveal action. The reveal receipt is sent by `X-MS-Source-Reveal-Receipt` rather than embedded in the URL.\n\n## Contract Coverage\n\n- Pre-attempt blocked/no asset ref exposure\n- Post-submit reveal allowed\n- Student-confirmed attempt reveal allowed\n- Same-page neighboring answer exposure warning\n- `document_only` / unavailable fallback without full document reveal\n- No wording that awards marks or says the learner earned a score\n- Public production flag-off behavior\n- Mobile-readable source area and usable zoom/pan controls\n\n## Required Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-integration-receipt.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-integration.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-integration-smoke.v1.json`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run test:coverage:learning-runtime` passed: 24 suites, 150 tests.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true node_modules/.bin/eslint ...` passed for edited JS/JSX files.\n- `npm run build` passed; Vite emitted existing Browserslist/chunk-size warnings.\n- `node scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-smoke.mjs` passed and refreshed receipt/validator artifacts.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with warnings only for expected dirty worktree / branch naming before commit.\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T07:15:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T07:36:17Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T07:36:17Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T07:36:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"02e24ac57a8048378051fa2058e085f5f7fbbdfb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1510/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1510/com